Package: mega2vcf
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2017-08-10
Title: Generate a VCF File from a Mega2 SQLite Database
Description: Generate a VCF file from a Mega2 SQLite database.  Also generate a .fam (family), a .phe (phenotype) and a few related file from the database data.
